   Author: Simon Wright
   Description: Implements XPath 1.0 in Ada
   GPR Scenario: LIBRARY_TYPE := static | relocatable
   License: GPL-3.0-or-later
   Long_Description: XIA is a native Ada implementation of the XPath 1.0 specification.  XIA is built using the DOM component of AdaCore's XML/Ada implementation and code generated by AdaGOOP.

Submitting XPath queries is done via the XIA.XPath_Query function. The function returns a Dom.Core.Node_List, whose contents can be accessed with the function DOM.Core.Nodes.Item.

